`MARGIN_Q` completed all 20 anchors. Its correctly paired pooled coordination span is **+1.2913%**, with 6 negative and 14 positive anchor-local committed-EE differences; the archived span was +0.5448%. The two joint arms matched on 0/20 configurations. `SEALED` is 10/20 and continuing.
